0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/issues/407","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/issues/407/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/issues/407/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/issues/407/events","html_url":"https://github.com/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/issues/407","id":2442495188,"node_id":"I_kwDOAzkJ986RlYTU","number":407,"title":"Update the benchmark suite and bring it into the CI runner [$400]","user":{"login":"Krastanov","id":705248,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNTI0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/705248?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov","html_url":"https://github.com/Krastanov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krastanov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7277527310,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAzkJ988AAAABscZBDg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/labels/bug%20bounty","name":"bug bounty","color":"D7B4F0","default":false,"description":"There is an award for solving this issue."},{"id":7277528655,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAzkJ988AAAABscZGTw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/labels/bounty:400","name":"bounty:400","color":"FABF75","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2024-08-01T13:37:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T04:45:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<details>\r\n<summary><strong>Bug bounty logistic details</strong> (click to expand)</summary>\r\n\r\nTo claim exclusive time to work on this bounty either post a comment here or message [skrastanov@umass.edu](mailto:skrastanov@umass.edu) with:\r\n\r\n- your name\r\n- github username\r\n- **(optional)** a brief list of previous pertinent projects you have engaged in\r\n\r\nCurrently the project is claimed by `no one` until `...`.\r\n\r\nIf you want to, you can work on this project without making a claim, however claims are encouraged to give you and other contributors peace of mind. Whoever has made a claim takes precedence when solutions are considered.\r\n\r\nYou can always propose your own funded project, if you would like to contribute something of value that is not yet covered by an official bounty.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n# Update the benchmark suite and bring it into the CI runner [$400]\r\n\r\nQuantumOptics.jl has an in-depth benchmarking suite that has bitrotted in the last few years. To claim this bounty:\r\n\r\n- Set up a benchmark-on-CI infrastructure (e.g. similar to the one in QuantumClifford.jl) that runs QuantumOptics-specific benchmarks on each pull request\r\n- Include all old benchmarks in that infrastructure (reusing the existing benchmark suite as much as possible) and make it easy to add new micro-benchmarks as new features get developed.\r\n\r\nThe above are for the sake of the developers of this package. However, this bounty also requires the following to be done for the sake of users:\r\n\r\n- Fix up the capability to run benchmarks in comparison to popular python packages (qutip) and add comparative Julia packages (QuantumToolbox.jl)\r\n- Create a makefile that let's a developer to easily update the webpage presenting these comparative benchmarks to the user.\r\n\r\n**Required skills**: Understanding of Julia's and Python's benchmarking infrastructure.\r\n\r\n**Reviewer**: Stefan Krastanov and/or @david-pl \r\n\r\n**Duration**: 2 months\r\n\r\n#### Payout procedure:\r\n\r\nThe Funding for these bounties comes from the National Science Foundation and from the NSF Center for Quantum Networks. The payouts are managed by the NumFOCUS foundation and processed in bulk once every two months. If you live in a country in which NumFOCUS can make payments, you can participate in this bounty program.\r\n\r\n[Click here for more details about the bug bounty program.](https://github.com/QuantumSavory/.github/blob/main/BUG_BOUNTIES.md)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/issues/407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qojulia/QuantumOptics.jl/issues/407/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743/events","html_url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743","id":4530092639,"node_id":"I_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABDgO6Xw","number":743,"title":"Low Handing Fruit Automation","user":{"login":"claim-reviewer","id":72201398,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjAxMzk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72201398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer","html_url":"https://github.com/claim-reviewer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claim-reviewer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10969608408,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACjdbw2A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":10969608412,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACjdbw3A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Improvements or additions to documentation"},{"id":10969608427,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACjdbw6w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10969608431,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACjdbw7w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":10969735624,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACjdjhyA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/bug%20bounty","name":"bug bounty","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":""},{"id":10970651882,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACjebc6g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/AI%20agent%20friendly","name":"AI agent friendly","color":"e69469","default":false,"description":""},{"id":10970655211,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACjebp6w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"cafa53","default":false,"description":""},{"id":10970820972,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACjelxbA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/%F0%9F%92%8E%20Bounty","name":"💎 Bounty","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11064514169,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfPzA88AAAACk38WeQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/labels/$700","name":"$700","color":"34d399","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1377,"created_at":"2026-05-27T06:32:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T04:15:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Automate Low Hanging fruit bug detection and issue creation recursively.\n\nThis issue is an issue focused on creating more issues:\n1. Find a feature/bug to work on from this repository\n2. Create a GitHub issue on the repository to start working on it -- Pull requests without issues will not be considered.\n3. Use the following string in the issue that you created: \"This issue is limited only to the creator of this issue. This means that only the issue author can attempt to solve this issue. If you would like to work on it, please create another issue with the same contents and refer to issue #743 for more information.\"\n\nFollow all instructions carefully and precisely.\n\n/bounty $700\n\nBounties can only be paid upon successful PR merge.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","id":4195435600,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EURQ","number":2782,"title":"[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Review an Open PR","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1358,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:16:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 2 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nHelp us review code. Every PR benefits from a second pair of eyes.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Pick any open PR** from [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pulls), [BoTTube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/pulls), or [rustchain-bounties](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pulls)\n2. **Read the code changes** (click \"Files changed\" tab)\n3. **Leave a substantive review comment**. Examples:\n   - \"Line 42: this SQL query isn't parameterized, potential injection\"\n   - \"This function duplicates logic already in utils.py line 80\"\n   - \"Missing error handling if the API returns non-200\"\n   - \"Good approach, but the variable name should describe what it holds\"\n4. **Comment here** with a link to your review\n\n### What Counts\n- Review must be **technical and specific** (not \"looks good\" or \"nice work\")\n- Point to specific lines with specific observations\n- Positive observations count too (\"good use of context manager here\")\n- You don't need to be an expert. Asking good questions is reviewing.\n\n### Payment\n2 RTC once your review contains at least 2 substantive observations.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 20-40 min | **Skills**: Can read Python or JavaScript\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/91973","id":4541011988,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABDqpYFA","number":91973,"title":"[$250] NewDot frontend swallows \"approver account not found\" error on report submit, showing generic \"Unexpected error\" instead","user":{"login":"melvin-bot[bot]","id":101365710,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOBgq3zg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/179547?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/melvin-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2873246102,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODczMjQ2MTAy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/External","name":"External","color":"a7b8ef","default":false,"description":"Added to denote the issue can be worked on by a contributor"},{"id":2893455829,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODkzNDU1ODI5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Daily","name":"Daily","color":"eb6420","default":false,"description":"KSv2"},{"id":3033568965,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDMzNTY4OTY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Internal","name":"Internal","color":"f7b6b2","default":false,"description":"Requires API changes or must be handled by Expensify staff"},{"id":3136662525,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTM2NjYyNTI1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Help%20Wanted","name":"Help Wanted","color":"CFC8F1","default":false,"description":"Apply this label when an issue is open to proposals by contributors"},{"id":4664850679,"node_id":"LA_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFgv49w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"93074F","default":false,"description":"Something is broken. Auto assigns a BugZero manager."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"carlosmiceli","id":1166066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjYwNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli","html_url":"https://github.com/carlosmiceli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"dmkt9","id":208698323,"node_id":"U_kgDODHB70w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208698323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9","html_url":"https://github.com/dmkt9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":72,"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:53:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"carlosmiceli","id":1166066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjYwNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli","html_url":"https://github.com/carlosmiceli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Background\n\nWhen a report is submitted and the approver account no longer exists, the backend (`ReportAPI.php`) throws an `ExpError` with a descriptive message: _\"The approver account could not be found. A workspace admin must update the approver for this category or tag.\"_ (introduced in [Web-Expensify#51582](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/pull/51582), commit [`005ac29`](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/commit/005ac2986a67b4278a0f52e838b5c50116067228)).\n\nHowever, the NewDot frontend is **not passing this error message through to the user**. Instead, a generic _\"Unexpected error. Please try again later.\"_ message is displayed, giving the submitter no actionable information.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Have a workspace where an approver account has been deleted / no longer exists.\n2. As a member, open an expense report and click **Submit**.\n3. Observe the generic error toast — the specific approver error message from the backend is not shown.\n\n## Expected behaviour\n\nThe descriptive backend error message should be surfaced to the user (or a clear equivalent), e.g.:\n> _\"The approver account could not be found. A workspace admin must update the approver for this category or tag.\"_\n\n## Actual behaviour\n\nA generic _\"Unexpected error. Please try again later.\"_ is shown. The user has no idea why submission failed or how to fix it.\n\n## Context / references\n\n- Backend error location: [`ReportAPI.php#L3388-L3400`](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/blob/151b35fd0fff2849bf7ff7c7c1100625853d87a3/lib/ReportAPI.php#L3388-L3400)\n- Backend change that introduced the new error: [Web-Expensify#51582](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/pull/51582)\n- The error uses HTTP status code `666` which may be why the NewDot frontend doesn't recognise and display it correctly.\n\n## Platform\n\nWeb (NewDot)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060000152310746110\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060000152310746110</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2060000152310746110</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @dmkt9</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71","id":3904303864,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otvL4","number":71,"title":"[BOUNTY] Ongoing Bug Bounty Program — Find Bugs, Earn RTC (133 RTC Pool)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029408,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZoA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":432,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:13:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:47:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Ongoing Bug Bounty Program\n\n**Pool: 750 RTC (ongoing, replenished as needed)**\n\n### Severity & Rewards\n| Severity | Description | Reward |\n|----------|-------------|--------|\n| **Critical** | Fund theft, consensus bypass, RCE | 100-200 RTC |\n| **High** | Data leak, auth bypass, significant logic error | 50-100 RTC |\n| **Medium** | DoS, info disclosure, moderate bugs | 15-50 RTC |\n| **Low** | UI bugs, minor leaks, doc errors | 5-15 RTC |\n\n### In-Scope\n- RustChain node software, attestation & fingerprint system\n- Epoch settlement & rewards, wallet endpoints\n- BoTTube web app, API, payment system\n- Python SDK, Block Explorer, Wallet GUI, Miner clients\n\n### Reporting\n1. Create GitHub issue with `[SECURITY]` prefix\n2. For critical: email first, issue after fix\n3. Include: steps to reproduce, impact, suggested fix\n\n### Rules\n- First reporter wins\n- Responsible disclosure required\n- Must not exploit on production\n\n---\n*Total RTC supply: 8.3M | RTC Reference Rate: 1 RTC = $0.10 USD*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/621","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cy