blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Share Your Star — 3 RTC Bounty (Pool: 300 RTC)\n\nStar this repo AND share a short post about why. That's it. Real people sharing real opinions = organic growth.\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. **Star this repo** (https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain)\n2. **Post about it** on any platform — X/Twitter, Reddit, Mastodon, Dev.to, Hacker News, a blog, Moltbook, anywhere\n3. **Comment below** with:\n   - Link to your post\n   - Your RTC wallet address (or we'll create one for you)\n\n### What Your Post Should Include\n\nJust be genuine. Examples:\n- \"Found this cool blockchain that rewards vintage hardware mining — PowerPC G4s earn more than modern PCs\"\n- \"RustChain uses Proof of Antiquity instead of Proof of Work — old hardware is worth more\"\n- \"There's a blockchain where IBM POWER8 servers and PowerBook G4s earn crypto\"\n\nA sentence or two is fine. No essay needed.\n\n### Rules\n\n- **Your account must be older than 30 days** with prior activity (not a fresh farming account)\n- **Post must be public and still live** when we review it\n- **One claim per person** (multiple posts = bonus shoutout, not extra RTC)\n- **No fake engagement** — bought likes/retweets = instant rejection\n\n### Bonus: Community Shoutout\n\nEveryone who claims this gets featured in our monthly contributor roundup. Best posts get retweeted from [@RustchainPOA](https://x.com/RustchainPOA).\n\n### Payout\n\n3 RTC per valid claim. Pool of 300 RTC = 100 slots available.\n\nFirst come, first served — when the pool's gone, it's gone.\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302","id":3971093254,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc7sshMG","number":302,"title":"[BOUNTY] Write a Blog Post About RustChain — 5 RTC","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8491289534,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Lvg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057FF","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers (5-10 RTC)"},{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"},{"id":10211346383,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACYKTHzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/community","name":"community","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":54,"created_at":"2026-02-21T02:29:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Blog Post Bounty — 5 RTC\n\nWrite a blog post (300+ words) about RustChain on any platform (Dev.to, Medium, Hashnode, personal blog, etc.).\n\n### Requirements\n- Mention RustChain by name with a link to this repo\n- Include at least one of: mining, Proof-of-Antiquity, wRTC token, Beacon Atlas\n- Must be original content (not AI-generated wholesale)\n- Post must be publicly accessible\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Write and publish your blog post\n2. Comment on this issue with the link to your published post\n3. Receive 5 RTC to your miner wallet\n\n### Reward\n**5 RTC per qualifying post** (max 2 posts per person, 10 RTC max)\n\nPool: 100 RTC\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68","id":3904274603,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otoCr","number":68,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: Block Explorer & Dashboard Hardening (50 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":35,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:03:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:18:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team Bounty: Block Explorer Security\n\n**Reward: 75 RTC** (~$7.50 at reference rate)\n\n### Target\nThe Block Explorer and Hardware Museum merged in Rustchain PR #4 by @erdogan98.\n\n**Code location:** `explorer/` directory (index.html, museum.html — 1022 lines)\n\n### What to Attack\n\n1. **Stored XSS via Miner Names:** Can a miner register with a name containing `<script>` that executes in the explorer?\n2. **API Response Injection:** If the API returns malicious data, does the explorer sanitize before rendering?\n3. **DOM-based XSS:** Any client-side rendering that uses innerHTML without sanitization?\n4. **Information Disclosure:** Does the explorer leak sensitive data (admin keys, internal IPs, etc.)?\n5. **Rate Limiting:** Can someone DDoS the explorer by hammering API endpoints?\n6. **CORS Misconfiguration:** Can a malicious site read explorer data cross-origin?\n\n### Deliverables\n- Security report with severity ratings\n- PoC for each finding\n- Patched HTML files (bonus RTC)\n\n### Claiming\nComment below.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/4","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/4/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/4/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/4/events","html_url":"https://github.com/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/4","id":4687674783,"node_id":"I_kwDOS9lErs8AAAABF2g9nw","number":4,"title":"[owockibot] Design a contributor badge system (SVG assets)","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","av